`a year with National Day on a Sunday` MEANS LIST `National Day on day 7`

`a year with Christmas on a Saturday` MEANS LIST `Christmas Day on day 13`

`a year with Chinese New Year starting on a Sunday` MEANS LIST `Chinese New Year first day on day 21`, `Chinese New Year second day on day 22`

`a year with Vesak Day on a Sunday` MEANS LIST `Vesak Day on day 28`

`a year with two holidays on a Wednesday` MEANS LIST `Hari Raya Puasa on day 31`, `Labour Day on day 31`

`a year with two holidays on a Sunday` MEANS LIST `Hari Raya Haji on day 35`, `Deepavali on day 35`

`a year with no clashes` MEANS LIST `National Day on day 7`, `Good Friday on day 40`

§ `s 2 and the Schedule`

#ASSERT `the number of days in the Schedule` EQUALS 11

#ASSERT `the day is a public holiday under s 2` `a day specified in the Schedule`
#ASSERT `the day is a public holiday under s 2` `the day after a Schedule day that falls on a Sunday`
#ASSERT NOT `the day is a public holiday under s 2` `the day after a Schedule day that falls on a Saturday`
#ASSERT `the day is a public holiday under s 2` `a day the President declares by Gazette notification under s 5(1)`
#ASSERT `the day is a public holiday under s 2` `an additional day the President declares by Gazette notification under s 5(2)`
#ASSERT NOT `the day is a public holiday under s 2` `a day the President announces without a Gazette notification`
#ASSERT NOT `the day is a public holiday under s 2` `a substitute day off agreed with an employer under s 6`

