§ `s 5 -- the President's declarations`

#ASSERT `a declaration under s 5 can make a public holiday` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a declaration under s 5 can make a public holiday` FALSE

#ASSERT `the s 5(2) power to add a day is available` 2
#ASSERT NOT `the s 5(2) power to add a day is available` 1

