#ASSERT `two Schedule days fall on the same day among` `a year with two holidays on a Sunday`
#ASSERT NOT `two Schedule days fall on the same day among` `a year with no clashes`
#ASSERT NOT `two Schedule days fall on the same day among` `a year with Chinese New Year starting on a Sunday`

